  - m_Id: 2986667585474560
    m_Localized: Seraphel Ascendant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986667585474561
    m_Localized: '"Phase II - Divinity of Light.

      Power 10, Vigor D12.


      Regenerating
      Light: when it reaches 10 Mana, it consumes it and recovers 8 HP, up to a maximum
      of 80.


      Absolute Purity: immune to all penalties.


      Double Seal:
      if it overcomes the defense, it applies 2 Seals.


      Increasing Conviction:
      +2 to attack total for each Seal on the target.


      Condemnation of the
      Three Seals: at 3 Seals the target automatically dies."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986667585474562
    m_Localized: Seraphel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986667585474563
    m_Localized: "\"Phase I - Priestess of Light. \nPower 8, Vigor D10, 80 HP.\n\nRegenerating
      Light: when it reaches 10 Mana, it consumes it and recovers 4 HP, up to a maximum
      of 80.\n\nSacred Seal: if it overcomes the defense it does not eliminate the
      target, but applies 1 Seal.\n\nIncreasing Conviction: +2 to the attack total
      for each Seal already present on the target.\n\nCondemnation of the Three Seals:
      at 3 Seals the target automatically dies.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
